<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NBS, Boland say in talks.</title>
<headline>NBS, Boland say in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>NBS Holdings Ltd and Boland Bank Holdings Ltd on Monday said in separate cautionary announcements that they were in talks about a possible closer association.</p>
<p>They said the talks, which were still at an early stage, could result in the expansion of their retail distribution networks. However, no details of a likely outcome were yet available.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution when dealing in either companies' shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
